{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-schedule#feature-1","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-schedule","commit":"773a8579cd2ff90aec9b38ccfaa2b94658a43878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-schedule 的功能「日程面板」：在 better-sidebar 的日程标签中按今天、本周或历史日历查看任务与完成统计。打开面板可添加日程，点击条目进入详情或编辑。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:549-676","src/client/index.js:762-783"]}
